# TYPOGRAPHY RULES (STRICT)

**Source:** `src/theme/typography.ts`, re-exported via `@/theme`.

---

## GOLDEN RULE

**NEVER use direct `fontSize`, `lineHeight`, `fontWeight`, or `fontFamily` in components.**  
**ALWAYS use `typography` tokens from `@/theme` for all text styling.**  
**NEVER use `typographyByWeight` — use flat `typography` tokens only.**

---

## Available Typography Tokens

All typography tokens are pre-scaled via `fontScale` and `lineHeightScale` internally.

### Typography Tokens (REQUIRED)

```typescript
import { typography } from '@/theme';

// Available tokens (flat structure):
typography.h1Bold, typography.h1SemiBold, typography.h1Medium, typography.h1Regular
typography.h2Bold, typography.h2SemiBold, typography.h2Medium, typography.h2Regular
typography.h3Bold, typography.h3SemiBold, typography.h3Medium, typography.h3Regular
typography.h4Bold, typography.h4SemiBold, typography.h4Medium, typography.h4Regular
typography.h5Bold, typography.h5SemiBold, typography.h5Medium, typography.h5Regular
typography.h6Bold, typography.h6SemiBold, typography.h6Medium, typography.h6Regular
typography.h7Bold, typography.h7SemiBold, typography.h7Medium, typography.h7Regular
typography.h8Bold, typography.h8SemiBold, typography.h8Medium, typography.h8Regular
typography.h0Bold, typography.h0SemiBold, typography.h0Medium, typography.h0Regular
typography.h10Bold, typography.h10SemiBold, typography.h10Medium, typography.h10Regular
typography.b1Bold, typography.b1SemiBold, typography.b1Medium, typography.b1Regular
typography.bodySmall1Bold, typography.bodySmall1SemiBold, typography.bodySmall1Medium, typography.bodySmall1Regular
typography.bodySmall2Bold, typography.bodySmall2SemiBold, typography.bodySmall2Medium, typography.bodySmall2Regular
typography.bodySmall3Bold, typography.bodySmall3SemiBold, typography.bodySmall3Medium, typography.bodySmall3Regular
```

---

## Typography Token Sizes

| Token | Font Size | Line Height | Use Case |
|---|---|---|---|
| `h1*` | 40px | 48px | Main page titles |
| `h2*` | 38px | 46px | Section headers |
| `h3*` | 36px | 42px | Subsection headers |
| `h4*` | 32px | 38px | Card titles |
| `h5*` | 30px | 36px | Large headings |
| `h6*` | 28px | 34px | Medium headings |
| `h7*` | 24px | 28px | Small headings |
| `h8*` | 22px | 26px | Tiny headings |
| `h0*` | 20px | 24px | Smallest headings |
| `h10*` | 18px | 22px | Micro headings |
| `b1*` | 16px | 20px | Body text |
| `bodySmall1*` | 14px | 16px | Small body, labels |
| `bodySmall2*` | 12px | 14px | Tiny text, captions |
| `bodySmall3*` | 10px | 12px | Micro text, icons |

*Each token has 4 weight variants: Bold, SemiBold, Medium, Regular

