## Usage Guide

### ✅ CORRECT — Use Typography Tokens

```typescript
import { typography, colors } from '@/theme';

// In StyleSheet
const styles = StyleSheet.create({
  title: {
    ...typography.h1Bold,
    color: colors.PrimaryMain,
  },
  label: {
    ...typography.bodySmall1Medium,
    color: colors.TextSecondaryDefault,
  },
  caption: {
    ...typography.bodySmall2Regular,
    color: colors.TextSecondaryHover,
  },
});

// In JSX
<Text style={typography.b1Regular}>Body text</Text>
<Text style={[typography.h7SemiBold, { color: colors.PrimaryMain }]}>
  Heading
</Text>
```

### ❌ WRONG — Direct Font Styling

```typescript
import { fontScale, lineHeightScale, moderateScale } from '@/theme';

// ❌ FORBIDDEN: Direct fontSize, lineHeight, fontWeight, fontFamily
const styles = StyleSheet.create({
  title: {
    fontSize: fontScale(24),           // ❌ Use typography.h7SemiBold
    lineHeight: lineHeightScale(28),    // ❌ Use typography.h7SemiBold
    fontWeight: '600',                  // ❌ Use typography.h7SemiBold
    fontFamily: 'Inter-SemiBold',       // ❌ Use typography.h7SemiBold
  },
  label: {
    fontSize: moderateScale(14),       // ❌ Use typography.bodySmall1Medium
    lineHeight: moderateScale(16),      // ❌ Use typography.bodySmall1Medium
  },
});
```

### ❌ WRONG — Using typographyByWeight

```typescript
import { typographyByWeight } from '@/theme';

// ❌ FORBIDDEN: Do NOT use typographyByWeight
const styles = StyleSheet.create({
  title: {
    ...typographyByWeight.h1.bold,  // ❌ Use typography.h1Bold instead
  },
  label: {
    ...typographyByWeight.bodySmall1.medium,  // ❌ Use typography.bodySmall1Medium instead
  },
});
```

---

## When to Use Typography Tokens

**MUST use typography tokens for:**

- ✅ `fontSize` — always use a typography token
- ✅ `lineHeight` — always use a typography token
- ✅ `fontWeight` — always use a typography token (via weight variant)
- ✅ `fontFamily` — always use a typography token (via weight variant)
- ✅ Any text styling that includes font properties

**DO NOT use typography tokens for:**

- ❌ `color` — use color tokens from `@/theme`
- ❌ `letterSpacing` — can be customized if needed (typography tokens have `letterSpacing: 0`)
- ❌ `textAlign`, `textDecorationLine`, etc. — these are layout/styling, not typography

---

## Spreading Typography Tokens

**Always spread the token** to include all properties:

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT: Spread the token
const styles = StyleSheet.create({
  title: {
    ...typography.h1Bold,
    color: colors.PrimaryMain,
  },
});

// ❌ WRONG: Don't pick individual properties
const styles = StyleSheet.create({
  title: {
    fontSize: typography.h1Bold.fontSize,  // ❌ Spread the whole token
    lineHeight: typography.h1Bold.lineHeight,
  },
});
```

---

## Combining Typography with Other Styles

```typescript
import { typography, colors, spacing } from '@/theme';

// ✅ CORRECT: Spread typography, add other styles
const styles = StyleSheet.create({
  container: {
    ...typography.b1Regular,
    color: colors.PrimaryMain,
    marginBottom: spacing['Spacing-xl'],
  },
});

// ✅ CORRECT: Inline with array
<Text style={[typography.h7SemiBold, { color: colors.PrimaryMain }]}>
  Title
</Text>
```

---

## If Token Doesn't Exist

**If you need a typography style that doesn't exist in the tokens:**

1. **First:** Check if a close token works (e.g., use `bodySmall1Medium` for 14px instead of 13px)
2. **If no close match:** Ask the user to add the token to `src/theme/typography.ts`
3. **NEVER** use `fontScale()`, `lineHeightScale()`, or direct font properties as a workaround
4. **NEVER** use `typographyByWeight` as a workaround

---

## Examples

### Component StyleSheet

```typescript
import { typography, colors, spacing } from '@/theme';

const styles = StyleSheet.create({
  title: {
    ...typography.h7SemiBold,
    color: colors.PrimaryMain,
    marginBottom: spacing['Spacing-xl'],
  },
  label: {
    ...typography.bodySmall1Medium,
    color: colors.TextSecondaryDefault,
  },
  body: {
    ...typography.b1Regular,
    color: colors.PrimaryMain,
  },
  caption: {
    ...typography.bodySmall2Regular,
    color: colors.TextSecondaryHover,
  },
});
```

### Inline Styles

```typescript
import { typography, colors } from '@/theme';

<Text style={typography.h1Bold}>Main Title</Text>
<Text style={[typography.b1Regular, { color: colors.PrimaryMain }]}>
  Body text
</Text>
```

### Custom Text Components

```typescript
import { typography, colors } from '@/theme';

const InfoLetter = (): React.ReactElement => (
  <Text style={[typography.bodySmall3SemiBold, { color: colors.TextSecondaryDefault }]}>
    i
  </Text>
);
```

### Conditional Typography

```typescript
import { typography } from '@/theme';

const labelStyle = size === 'default'
  ? typography.b1Regular
  : typography.bodySmall2Regular;
```

